Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:22.75,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}狙いさだめた  指先がさす
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:25.12,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}運命は絶望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:27.72,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}それとも希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:34.17,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}ゆらぎの中で  受信してゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:36.31,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}悲しみにも負けない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:39.00,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}勇気だけをください
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.47,0:22:45.25,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}大切なもの  守るため
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.32,0:22:50.66,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}「強さ」はあると信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:56.52,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future　一緒に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:59.68,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}明日へのドア開いた空へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:02.14,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛び立とう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.29,0:23:08.00,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}とある世界の果てで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:13.76,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}駆け抜けてく　Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:21.38,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}光を放って!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:22.75,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}那命中注定的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:25.12,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}是絕望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:27.72,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}還是希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:34.17,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}在搖擺中 發送著信息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:36.31,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}請賜予我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:39.00,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}不會向悲傷低頭的勇氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.47,0:22:45.25,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}為了保護珍貴的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.32,0:22:50.66,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}我相信自己的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:56.52,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future  讓我們一同
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:59.68,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}敞開明天的門  向開闊的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:02.14,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}展翅高飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.29,0:23:08.00,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}向那世界的彼端
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:13.76,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛馳而去 Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:21.38,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}散發出光芒!
